   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "三个 VARIERA 瓦瑞拉 塑料袋抽取盒挂在阳台的墙壁上，当播种器用。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/59/34/593440e21c298fcf547b916665cf220f.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/59/34/593440e21c298fcf547b916665cf220f.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "特写：墙壁上挂着 VARIERA 瓦瑞拉 塑料袋抽取盒，用来种植花卉和球茎植物。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "60182238"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/ef/41/ef415122a42e8d31f4ec6aa9c7f09483.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/ef/41/ef415122a42e8d31f4ec6aa9c7f09483.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>1.用意想不到的物件当播种器。</strong>例如，塑料袋抽取盒。往盒子里随意塞些旧报纸，然后再添些土壤，用来种植球根植物或其他植物。采用这种方法种植可为生长、通风和浇水提供充足的空间。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "盆栽藤蔓植物摆在凳子下方，并沿着凳子向上生长。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "80307954"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/33/01/3301d0657cbfbe5ec88f49609e79fc3b.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/33/01/3301d0657cbfbe5ec88f49609e79fc3b.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>2.没错，它确实是个凳子，但为什么不可以当作棚架用呢？</strong>把它悬挂在盆栽植物上空，让常春藤和其他藤蔓植物沿着棚架生长。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "三个DIY棚架分别是用床板板条、金属刀叉和木质厨用器具制成的。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "80278466"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/68/9b/689bedbbc6470052783c9bd8f328ab60.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/68/9b/689bedbbc6470052783c9bd8f328ab60.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "一位女士正在锯床板木条，用来定制打造棚架。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/6c/7b/6c7b732941c49f85d2aed5ead2bce092.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/6c/7b/6c7b732941c49f85d2aed5ead2bce092.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>3.制作颇具田园风格的棚架</strong>&nbsp;通过测量和切割（或根据你所想要的大小选择是否切割）<a href=\"https://www.ikea.cn/cn/zh/cat/chuang-ban-tiao-24827/\">床板</a>木条，试着把大小相同的木条以一定间距挂在一起。为了打造更具家庭生活气息的外观，你甚至还可以尝试使用厨用器具。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "墙壁上挂着几个金属棚架，上面挂着生长在小玻璃容器中的植物",
