   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "塑料苏打瓶用线挂在金属棚架上，里面装满了供植物生长的土壤。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/1a/56/1a56140fa95cd1b64cb9e6898faccf19.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/1a/56/1a56140fa95cd1b64cb9e6898faccf19.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>4.如果空间不够，可以把墙面利用起来。</strong>安装一些金属棚架，用园艺金属丝将塑料苏打瓶、小玻璃管和花瓶挂在金属棚架上，非常适于安装灯泡和修剪根茎。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "红色手推车中装满了园艺配件和植物。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/ac/8f/ac8fcc82efc21e49d732b2abfa06949c.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/ac/8f/ac8fcc82efc21e49d732b2abfa06949c.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "红色手推车的顶层搁板上摆满了花盆，里面育有幼苗。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "40331767"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/26/e5/26e5d88252e2dd84f0fb5369813bc7e3.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/26/e5/26e5d88252e2dd84f0fb5369813bc7e3.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>5.手推车也能打造出色的小空间园艺方案。</strong>&nbsp;挑选一辆分层的手推车，根据需求规划一下每层要放的物件：把新育的幼苗和需要浇水的植物放在最顶层，其余的花盆和工具放在中间的搁板上，较重的土壤放在最底层。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "两个塑料 SAMLA 萨姆拉 储物盒用作播种器来种植生菜和香葱等可食用的植物。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "30180943"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/33/11/3311a31ef62f79f0f2bed90735226daf.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/33/11/3311a31ef62f79f0f2bed90735226daf.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>6.塑料盒非常适合用作园艺用品，</strong>尽管它看上去不太常用，但是非常便于搬动和重新摆放植物。记得在底部打几个洞，方便排水。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "木制盒子里种满了盆栽植物，放在绿色的野餐桌上。",
